    "detailed_description": "In addition to the local drives on your computer, do you have several external storage devices, such as HD and pen drives?<br><br>Every time you want to find a file or project do you have to connect each of these devices individually and suffer from slow Windows search?<br><br>Discover <strong>Neuria UltraIndex</strong>. It's easy to use and quick to search. It's the definitive solution you need.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Index as many drives as you want</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Search your files even when your device is disconnected</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Search only folders, only files or the full path</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use wildcards</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open the file, view in Windows Explorer or view properties</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Instant Search</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your drives and files are unchanged</li></ul>",
